"Click a shortcut to record a new key combination. It must include ⌘ or ⌃. Some shortcuts may be reserved by macOS or another app." = "点按快捷键以录制新的组合键。组合键必须包含 ⌘ 或 ⌃。某些快捷键可能已被 macOS 或其他 App 占用。";
"This shortcut needs ⌘ or ⌃. Click it to record a new one." = "此快捷键需要包含 ⌘ 或 ⌃。点按它以录制新的快捷键。";
"System Mount Rule Update Cancelled" = "由于已取消管理员密码提示，MountMate 未更新 /etc/fstab 中的启动规则。在更新之前，macOS 启动时可能仍会使用旧规则。";
"A previous connection attempt to “%@” is still in progress." = "之前连接“%@”的尝试仍在进行中。";
"MountMate could not determine whether “%@” is an external disk, so it was not ejected. Try again in a moment." = "MountMate 无法确定“%@”是否为外置磁盘，因此未将其推出。请稍后再试。";
"Remove Anyway" = "仍然移除";
"“%@” could not be unmounted, so it stays mounted. You can still remove it from MountMate; no files on the share are touched.\n\n%@" = "无法卸载“%@”，因此它仍保持挂载。你仍可将其从 MountMate 中移除；共享上的文件不会受到影响。\n\n%@";
"“%@” is already connected, probably under a different server name (for example in Finder). Disconnect it there and try again." = "“%@”已连接，可能使用了不同的服务器名称（例如在访达中）。请在那里断开连接后重试。";
